~ start
# talk_to entry for the lab-corridor guard (guard_advanced_overlay launches here).
# stage_party reads conversation_player_on_left — set by interactable.gd the moment the
# interaction fires — and stages Fiona, the following companion (back row) and the guard
# with the right flips. one line instead of the old per-side if/else.
do stage_party("Lewgend", "explaining_1")
Lewgend: Lab's closed. Clearance holders only past this point.
Player: We work here.
if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
	Layla: Technically we're grad students. It's complicated.
	Lewgend: Then it's simple for me.
do actor_change("Lewgend", "hand_on_chest")
Lewgend: No card, no lab. Nothing personal.
Player: Noted.
=> END
